      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصْفَةٌ</span></b>  [as an inf. n. un. of 1 signifies <i>A gust,</i> or
<i>strong puff,</i> of wind. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,] (assumed tropical:)  The <i>odour,</i>
(K,) or <i>fragrance</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَغْمَة</span>) <i>of odour,</i> (Z, TA,) or
<i>exhaled odour,</i> (IF, O,) of wine: (IF, Z, O, K,
TA:) likened to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصْفَة</span> of wind. (Z, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
